If the gene names are compatible (and mark the same thing in rat as in mouse) then I don't see why there would be a problem. Perhaps try classifying using just a few cell types and known markers to see if the issue is with the mouse versus rat markers or something else? Do all the gene names get translated? i.e. when you run check_markers, does it look like all the marker genes are present in the training CDS?

Hannah

